# Copy the Arduino AVR core files here if you want a custom core.
# Source: https://github.com/arduino/ArduinoCore-avr/tree/master/cores/arduino
#
# Then update boards.txt:
#   multiduino.build.core=arduino          (local cores/arduino/)
# instead of:
#   multiduino.build.core=arduino:arduino  (bundled Arduino core)
